ias a la vida) / Violeta Parra. El condor pasa (If I could) / Daniel A. Robles, Jorge Milchberg, Paul Simon. Jamaica farewell / Lord Irving Burgess. Sometimes I feel like a motherless child / spirituaali. En natt i Moskva / Soloviev-Sedol, ruots. san. H&#229;kan Elmqvist. O sole mio / Eduardi di Capua. Amazing grace / trad. Jag v&#228;ntar vid min mila / Gunnar Tureson. Balladen om Herr Fredrik &#197;kare och den s&#246;ta fr&#246;ken Cecilia Lind ; Grimasch om morgonen / Cornelis Vreeswijk. Blomman / Martin Koch. Dagny / Owe Th&#246;rnqvist. Kungens man / Bj&#246;rn Afzelius. S&#229;ng till friheten (El Dia feliz qui est&#224; llegando) / Silvio Rodriguez. Flickan och kr&#229;kan ; Ska nya r&#246;ster sjunga ; Titanic / Mikael Wiehe. Nu g&#229;r sista visan ; &#214;verbyvals / Carl Anton Alexander. Mitt eget land ; Trubbel / Olle Adolphson. Visa i Molom / Alf Hambe. Dr&#246;mmens skepp / Staffan Percy. S&#229;ngen om sommaren ; Visa vid vindens &#228;ngar ; Barfotavisan / Mats Paulson. Underbart &#228;r kort / Povel Ramel. Stockholm i mitt hj&#228;rta / Lars Berghagen. En valsmelodi / Lille Bror S&#246;derlundh, san. Nils Ferlin. Den vackraste visan / Lille Bror S&#246;derlundh, san. Ture Nerman. M&#229;ltidss&#229;ng = S&#229; lunka vi s&#229; sm&#229;ningom (Fredmans s&#229;nger 12) ; N&#229; skruva fiolen (Fredmans epistel 2) ; Solen glimmar (Fredmans epistel 48) / Carl Michael Bellman. Calle Schewens vals ; S&#229; l&#228;nge skutan kan g&#229; ; Vals p&#229; Kariben ; Rosa p&#229; bal ; Dansen p&#229; Sunnan&#246; ; &#196;nglamark ; Nocturne ; H&#228;r &#228;r den sk&#246;na sommar ; S&#229; skimrande var aldrig havet ; Fritiof och Carmencita / Evert Taube. Sommarpsalm / Waldemar &#197;hl&#233;n. I denna ljuva sommartid / Nathan S&#246;derblom. Sommar, sommar, sommar / Sten Roland ja Erik Sandstr&#246;m. I sommarens soliga dagar / vanha marssimelodia. Dansen g&#229;r p&#229; Svinnsta sk&#228;r    / Gideon Wahlberg. De' &#228;' dans p&#229; Br&#228;nn&#246; brygga / Lasse Dahlqvist. Visa vid midsommartid / H&#229;kan Norl&#233;n. &#214;ppna landskap ; K&#228;rleken f&#246;rde oss samman / Ulf Lundell. Sol, vind och vatten ; F&#246;r k&#228;rlekens skull / Ted G&#228;rdestad. Sommaren &#228;r kort / Tomas Ledin. Du &#228;r den ende / M. &#214;sterdahl ja C. Petterson. K&#228;rleksvals / Ulrik Neumann. Jag ger dig min morgon = I give you the morning / Tom Paxton. I folkviseton / Torgny Bj&#246;rk, san. Nils Ferlin. Av l&#228;ngtan till dig / Jan Krantz. &#196;nnu doftar k&#228;rlek / Marie Fredriksson ja Lasse Lindbom. H&#229;ll mitt hj&#228;rta (Same old story) / Peter Hallstr&#246;m ja Lasse Andersson. Majas visa ; Ute bl&#229;ser sommarvind ; Videvisan / Alice Tegn&#233;r. Lille katt ; Jag g&#246;r s&#229; att blommorna blommar ; Idas sommarvisa ; Hujedamej, s&#229;n't barn han var! ; Fattig bonddr&#228;ng / Georg Riedell. H&#228;r kommer Pippi L&#229;ngstrump / Jan Johansson. Blommig falukorv / Hans Alfredson. Only love (L'amour en h&#233;ritage) / Vladimir Cosma.  Ett glas &#246;l (ur 88-&#246;resrevyn) / Kennedy Russell. Att ang&#246;ra en brygga / Lars F&#228;rnl&#246;f. As time goes by (ur Casablanca) / Herman Hupfeld. Gabriellas s&#229;ng (ur S&#229; som i himmelen) / Stefan Nilsson. Sailing / Gavin Sutherland. Bridge over troubled water / Paul Simon. Annie's song / John Denver. House of the rising sun / trad. A whiter shade of pale / Keith Reid ja Gary Brooker. Raindrops keep fallin' on my head / Bacharach. Georgia on my mind / Carmichael. Imagine / Lennon. The rose / Amanda McBroom. Trettifyran (This ole house) / Stuart Hamblen. Sakta vi g&#229; genom stan (Walkin' my baby back home) / Roy Turk ja Fred E. Ahlert, es. Monica Zetterlund. G&#229; och fiska. I will survive / Dino Fekaris ja Frederick Perren. N&#228;r min v&#228;n / Owe Th&#246;rnqvist. I natt jag dr&#246;mde (Last night I had the strangest dream) / Ed McCurdy. H&#246;stvisa / Erna Tauro, san. Tove Jansson. S&#228;g det i toner / Jules Sylvain (Stig Hansson). Goodbye yellow brick road / Elton John, san. Bernard Taupin. Thank you for the music / Benny Andersson ja Bj&#246;rn Ulvaeus.</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2=" " tag="546"><subfield code="a">svenska, englanti</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2=" " tag="574"><subfield code="a">marjasirkka.paaso@hel.fi</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="650"><subfield code="a">folkvisor</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="650"><subfield code="a">barnvisor</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="650"><subfield code="a">schlager</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="650"><subfield code="a">popmusik</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="650"><subfield code="a">filmmusik</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="650"><subfield code="a">scenmusik</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="650"><subfield code="a">s&#229;nger</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="651"><subfield code="a">Ruotsi</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="651"><subfield code="a">Sverige</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="655"><subfield code="a">laulukirjat</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1=" " ind2="7" tag="655"><subfield code="a">s&#229;ngb&#246;cker</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1="1" ind2=" " tag="700"><subfield code="a">&#214;sterberg, Gunlis,</subfield><subfield code="e">toimittaja</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1="1" ind2=" " tag="700"><subfield code="a">Bellman, Carl Michael,</subfield><subfield code="e">s&#228;velt&#228;j&#228;</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1="0" ind2=" " tag="700"><subfield code="a">Gustaf,</subfield><subfield code="e">s&#228;velt&#228;j&#228;</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1="1" ind2=" " tag="700"><subfield code="a">Tureson, Gunnar,</subfield><subfield code="e">s&#228;velt&#228;j&#228;</subfield></datafield><datafield ind1="1" ind2=" " tag="700"><subfield